TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Kasabamızdaki süper kullanışlı {{TAG:0011:0006:0000}}
sayesinde karanlıkta dolanmak yok! {{TAG:0003:0005:}}Orada
gece gündüz takılabilirim resmen!

{{TAG:0003:0017:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0006:0000}}, öyle mi? Şu tabela bana
ne anlatmaya çalışıyor acaba!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}Keşke konuşabilse!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Chachi! Cuando veo es{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD02006500020061000000}}
{{TAG:0011:0006:0000}}, {{TAG:0003:001D:}}¡me dan
ganas de montar una fiesta!

EN:
Our town's {{TAG:0003:002B:}}{{TAG:0011:0006:0000}} 
would be the perfect place to air
one of my concerts!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Everyone in town would love it!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Note to self: make this happen!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}¡Es{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD02006500020061000000}} {{TAG:0011:0006:0000}} sería
ideal para retransmitir uno de
mis conciertos!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Todo el mundo estaría encantado!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:0500}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}(Nota mental: ¡hazlo realidad!){{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0006:0000}}
sarebbe perfetto sul palco
di un mio concerto!
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Tutti in città ne andrebbero pazzi!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Devo fare di tutto per realizzare
questo sogno!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Si tu fais sonner {{TAG:000E:0002:}}
{{TAG:0011:0006:0000}} trois fois en
pensant à quelqu'un...
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}... cette personne tombera
follement amoureuse de toi !{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}Véridique. {{TAG:0007:0001:}}Ou pas.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Au choix !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Sai che se suoni
{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0006:0000}}
insieme alla persona che ti piace...
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}... Resterete innamorati, tipo,
per tutta la vita?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0015:}}Sissì.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} O forse no.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:000C:}}L'ho appena inventato.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Bir keresinde kasabanın {{TAG:0011:0006:0000}}
üzerinde o kadar çok döndüm ki midem
bulandı. {{TAG:0003:0028:}}Ama zavallı {{TAG:0011:0006:0000}}
suçlamayın! {{TAG:0003:001B:}}Hakkını vereyim, üç saat
falan üstündeydim.

{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Biliyor musun, bazen kasabanın {{TAG:0011:0006:0000}}
üstüne çıkıp solo çalışıyorum! {{TAG:0003:0015:}}Akustiği
inanılmaz! {{TAG:0003:0026:}}La la la la la!
